                        "tags": [
                            "plural-normally"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e83215d6-1ee3-4225-9202-9efd9d9cda91",
                                "sense_id": "fb76d4a5-4912-3abb-a47d-1e1b76c1975c",
                                "text": "Проходивший франтик с рыжими кудряшками и голубою лентою на низкой шляпе обернулся и с язвительною усмешкой посмотрел сквозь стеклышко на Бамбаева.",
                                "translation": "A passing dandy with reddish curls and a blue ribbon on his low hat, turned round and stared through his eyeglass with a sarcastic smile at Bambaev.",
                                "english": "A passing dandy with reddish curls and a blue ribbon on his low hat, turned round and stared through his eyeglass with a sarcastic smile at Bambaev."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
